[
  {"id":"family-daily-1-1","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の中で、朝いちばんに話したくなる話題は？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-2","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家の中で一番落ち着く場所はどこ？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-3","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族で食べるなら、今何を食べたい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-4","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の口ぐせで思い浮かぶものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-5","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"休日の家族時間は、外出派？家で過ごす派？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-6","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と一緒に見るなら、映画とドラマどっちがいい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-7","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の中で一番早起きなのは誰？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-8","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族からもらって嬉しかったものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-9","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家にあると安心するものは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-10","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族で旅行するなら、海と山どっちに行きたい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-11","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"最近、家族にありがとうと思ったことは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-12","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の中で、自分と性格が似ている人はいる？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-13","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と一緒に挑戦してみたいことは？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-14","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の写真を撮るなら、どんな瞬間を残したい？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-15","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族の話で、つい笑ってしまう思い出は？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-16","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家で続いている小さな習慣はある？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-17","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族におすすめしたい本や作品は？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-18","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と季節を感じるのは、どんな時？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-19","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族と静かに過ごす時間は好き？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-1-20","audience":"family","level":1,"text":"家族から言われると嬉しい言葉は？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-1","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族とは毎日連絡を取りたい？必要な時だけでいい？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-2","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と意見が違った時、すぐ話し合いたい？少し時間を置きたい？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-3","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に謝るのは得意？苦手？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-4","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"困った時、家族に相談する方？一人で考える方？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-5","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族で決めることと、自分で決めたいことの違いは？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-6","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に助けてほしい時、どんな頼み方なら言いやすい？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-7","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族のいいところを一つ挙げるなら？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-8","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に直してほしいと思うことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-9","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族にも知られたくないことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-10","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に応援してほしいことはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-2-11","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族との距離が近すぎると感じる時はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-12","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"失敗したことを家族に話せる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-13","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の中で考え方が一番違うと感じることは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-14","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族でお金の話をするのは大事だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-daily-2-15","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族と過ごす時間は、長さと密度のどちらが大事？","category":"familyDaily","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-16","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に期待しすぎているかもしれないと思うことは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-17","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族の中で自分が担っている役割は何だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-2-18","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族が元気がない時、そっとしておく？声をかける？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-2-19","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族に言いにくいけれど、伝えた方がいいと思うことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-2-20","audience":"family","level":2,"text":"家族について、自分が思い込んでいたことはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-1","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に自分の考えを分かってもらえない時、どうしたい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-2","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族だからこそ分かってほしいと思うことは？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-3","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と価値観が違っても、一緒にいられると思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-4","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族のために我慢していることはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-5","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の期待に応えたい気持ちと、自分の気持ちはどちらを優先したい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-6","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に本音を話すために必要なことは何だと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-7","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の関係をよくしているものは何だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-8","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と違う道を選ぶことに不安はある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-9","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族にとっての幸せは、自分にとっての幸せと同じだと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-10","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に変わってほしいと思うことを、伝えるべきだと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-11","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"自分が家族を支える側になることを想像したことはある？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-12","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族の過去について、もっと知りたいことはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-13","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に伝えられていない謝りたいことはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-14","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族が困っていたら、自分の予定をどこまで変えられる？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-3-15","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族にとっての安心感は、言葉と行動のどちらで生まれると思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-3-16","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族と意見が合わない時、理解することと納得することは別だと思う？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-3-17","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族から受け継いだと思うものはある？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-3-18","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族との距離を自分で決めたいと思う時はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-3-19","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"家族に弱さを見せることは、頼ることだと思う？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-3-20","audience":"family","level":3,"text":"これから家族とどんな時間を増やしたい？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-1","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に傷つけられたと感じた時、どうすれば自分を守れる？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-2","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族だから許さなければいけない、と思うことはある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-3","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に言えないまま抱えている気持ちはある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-4","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の期待を背負うことに疲れた時、誰に相談したい？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-5","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族と距離を置くことは、関係を大切にする方法にもなり得る？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-6","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族が自分の選択を認めてくれなかったら、どうする？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-7","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に謝ってほしいことがあるなら、伝える？待つ？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-8","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に謝りたいことがあるなら、今伝えられる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-9","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族を守るために黙ることと、正直に話すことはどちらが大切？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-10","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の事情と自分の人生がぶつかったら、どこで線を引きたい？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-11","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の中で決められた役割から離れたいと思ったことはある？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-12","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に理解されないままでも、自分の選択を進められる？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-care-4-13","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に助けを求めることをためらうのは、なぜだと思う？","category":"familyCare","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-14","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に本当は分かってほしいことを、一つだけ伝えるなら何？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-15","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族との関係を変えるために、自分からできることはある？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-values-4-16","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族のお金の問題を、自分の問題としてどこまで引き受ける？","category":"familyValues","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-memories-4-17","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族の過去を知ることで、今の関係の見え方が変わると思う？","category":"familyMemories","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-boundaries-4-18","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族にも越えてほしくない境界線はある？","category":"familyBoundaries","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-communication-4-19","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"家族に言葉で伝えられていない感謝はある？","category":"familyCommunication","source":"editorial"},
  {"id":"family-future-4-20","audience":"family","level":4,"text":"これから家族とどんな関係をつくっていきたい？","category":"familyFuture","source":"editorial"}
]
